  "general_information": "R/V GUNNERUS is a multipurpose research vessel owned by the Norwegian University of Science and Technology (NTNU). It was designed by Polarkonsult AS, built by Larsnes Mekaniske Verksted and delivered in 2006, with a prolongation completed in 2019. The vessel uses diesel-electric propulsion with two azimuth propulsion units, three main generators and a bow tunnel thruster. It carries scientific, hydrographic, positioning, laboratory, communications and safety equipment for coastal research operations.",
